{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚地串起了熟悉生活闯入、失去感被照亮、愿望无处安放、惊悸后紧张持续累积且无从释放的因果链，也抓住了身体先于念头的反应和舞步鲜明不等于情绪好转；但它较快把熟悉材料解释成对过去生活的认出，没有充分区分舞曲主题可能的再现与生活记忆的联想，也没有具体展开场景骤变本身如何打断先前的思绪。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版不仅解释了身体为何在安宁尚未被心理充分接纳时先行惊惧，也说明了熟悉材料为何不能恢复秩序、继续加力为何只会带来消耗而不能换回把握，并明确区分主题再现与生活记忆联想；但它把198–205解释为外冲的力量逐渐耗尽并转成屏息等待，弱化了听感记录中连续颤音引起思绪反复翻转、紧张层层累积且始终找不到出口的动态感。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版对身体反应、心理转折及应对方式失效的因果机制交代得更具体，也更谨慎地区分不同材料的解释，而它对198–205的等待感虽略有过度定向，仍不足以抵消其解释上的优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4448e1b8-6fa4-4882-8bee-afdcd5dc5835", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135509934107Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:56:19.828996+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1d79439ad482fe37f877ed895393f5148f0ce00097f954f8623e9c1f5f45b41a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f